{"id": 39, "ts": 1781184358.813226, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I appreciate James\u2019s point that Candidate\u202fD shows strong reliability\u2011related traits\u2014taking responsibility seriously, responding adequately to unexpected events, and solving problems extremely well. However, both Sarah and James confirm we have no concrete evidence of his crew\u2011cooperation or how he interacts with others, and the earlier note that he is regarded as a loner and moody raises a red flag for teamwork in the cockpit. Given that crew cooperation and professional communication are non\u2011negotiable for long\u2011haul operations, the uncertainty around D\u2019s ability to work constructively with a crew outweighs his reliability strengths. Therefore, I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fB is still the best overall fit, as we have clear evidence of both reliability (very conscientious) and stress resilience, despite his interpersonal quirks."}
